<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">A screen that stays blank, a laptop that charges slowly or a dock that behaves differently after reconnection can have several causes. The connector shape alone does not tell you whether a cable carries video, power or both. Work from the exact laptop, dock, display and cable combination in front of you. Save your work, change one thing at a time and keep the original arrangement available so you can reverse the test.</p>
<section class="ed-start" id="start" aria-labelledby="start-heading"><p class="ed-label">Start here</p><h2 id="start-heading">Start with the connection path</h2><p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">Trace the signal and power route from the computer to the screen, then check the operating-system arrangement.</p><div class="ed-choices">
